type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A student targeting this career should ideally graduate with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong company-law knowledge"},{"text":"Corporate-governance understanding"},{"text":"Legal research skills"},{"text":"Corporate drafting ability"},{"text":"Board-meeting knowledge"},{"text":"Compliance-calendar experience"},{"text":"Regulatory research capability"},{"text":"Basic securities-law knowledge"},{"text":"M&A fundamentals"},{"text":"Due-diligence exposure"},{"text":"Advanced Excel skills"},{"text":"Digital compliance-tool familiarity"},{"text":"Professional communication"},{"text":"Understanding of the ICSI qualification pathway"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"5+ Corporate Law Research Notes"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"3+ Board Resolution Drafts"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"2+ Meeting / Minutes Samples"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"1 Corporate Compliance Calendar"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"1 Corporate Governance Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"1 M&A / Due Diligence Project"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"1 Securities Regulation Research Project"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"1 CS / Corporate-Law Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For Company Secretary, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LLB","ICSI Professional Qualification","Company Law","Corporate Governance","Regulatory Compliance","Securities Knowledge","Legal Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The LLB gives the graduate a strong legal foundation, but the professional CS pathway is essential for becoming a qualified Company Secretary. Combining both can create a particularly strong profile for corporate governance, listed-company compliance, legal & compliance departments, corporate restructuring, securities regulation, and senior governance leadership."}]}]}